<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n58958" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοπή</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cutting</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χόρτος εἰς κοπὴν καὶ ἐπινομήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>POxy.</u>
					499.15
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>cutting in pieces, slaughter</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Jo.</u>
				10.20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ep.Hebr.</u>
				7.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. τριχός</span>, tax levied on <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γερδιοραβδισταί</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PAmh.</u>
				2.119.4
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				200
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
			</span></i>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PFay.</u>
				58.7
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>breaking up</i>, [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεφῶν</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mu.</u>
				394a34
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b>
			<i>pounding</i> in a mortar, <i><span class="en">
				Alex.Aphr.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				1.67
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>6.</b>
			<i>dressing</i> of stone, <i><span class="en">
				<u>CPHerm.</u>
				127
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A. D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>7.</b>
			<i>striking, minting</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νομίσματος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Inscr.Délos</u>
					461
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Aa</u>
				76
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>8.</b>
			<i>divorce</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aq.
				<u>De.</u>
				24.3
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόπος</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				11
			</span></i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλοίσβου μετὰ κοπήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					479
				</span></i>
			 codd. <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
			</span></i> (sed leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόπον</span>).</div>
